resources.string:
To use this application you must provide your own copy of the game (a .nsp file) and your key file (prod.keys). This application does not include, download or distribute games or keys.

By tapping "I accept and continue", you declare and confirm that:

1. the ROM (.nsp) and prod.keys were obtained by you legally, from a console and a copy of the game that you own;
2. you are solely responsible for the use of these files and will not share or distribute them;
3. this is an independent project, with no affiliation with Nintendo, Warner Bros. Games, Avalanche Software or any other company.
